# Personal access token used to read the pinned repositories on the GitHub
# profile. Pins are exposed only through GitHub's authenticated GraphQL API
# (`user.pinnedItems`) — the public REST API cannot return them.
#
# Without this the Contributions section still works: it falls back to the
# top public repositories by stars and labels itself accordingly.
#
# A classic token with NO scopes ticked is enough for public repositories.
# Create one at https://github.com/settings/tokens, then copy this file to
# `.env.local` (which is gitignored) and fill it in.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
